---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Emergency Roof Repair Wake Forest NC | 24/7 Service" description="24/7 emergency roof repair in Wake Forest, NC. Fast tarping, leak stops, and permanent fixes. Licensed local roofers. Call (919) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → <a href="/#services">Services</a> → Emergency Roof Repair</div>
      <h1>Emergency Roof Repair</h1>
      <p>When a leak or storm damage hits, we respond around the clock to protect your Wake Forest home.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>24/7 Emergency Response</h2>
      <p>Active leaks, missing sections after a storm, or sudden damage cannot wait. Our emergency crew provides temporary tarping to stop water intrusion, then schedules permanent repair as soon as conditions allow.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week</li>
        <li>Fast response goal for Wake Forest and northern Wake County</li>
        <li>Stocked trucks with tarps, underlayment, and common repair materials</li>
        <li>No after-hours surcharge surprises — transparent pricing</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What We Handle</h2>
      <p>Storm-blown shingles, punctures from fallen limbs, active ceiling leaks, and compromised flashing. We stabilize first, then restore.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay} Now</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
